                 0.084 m total height. 6 mm of clearance is +/-11.3 deg of elevation
                 at this radius, against a rendered tile row of 0.097 deg, so the
                 elevation-0 row cannot clip a cap edge. -->
            <geom
              name="lidar_rear_body_upper"
              type="cylinder"
              size="0.030 0.018"
              pos="0 0 0.024"
              rgba="0.2 0.2 0.2 1"
